The Holiday Guide''s At the Store list names the plant-based roasts, gravies, butters, creams and desserts in stores this season, by brand: Tofurky''s Plant-Based Roast & Gravy, Field Roast''s Celebration Roast, Gardein''s Turk''y Roast, Imagine and Primal Kitchen mushroom gravies, Country Crock Plant Butter, Miyoko''s, Earth Balance, Silk and Country Crock heavy creams, So Delicious CocoWhip and more. Stock changes by store, so read the label and check before you go.

The full list is free in the Holiday Guide. Link in bio.

